  "body": [
    "Playbook is designed to grow with your catalog, organizing product shots, licensed artwork, and campaign files across markets. Keep your team and partners in the loop with clear approvals while shipping campaign on time.",
    "1 Centralize your product catalog. Store all product shots, packaging, and campaign creative in one visual library. Our smart board let you apply tags and fields automatically.",
    "Store all product shots, packaging, and campaign creative in one visual library. Our smart board let you apply tags and fields automatically.",
    "2 Simplify approvals. Cut approval cycles by 50% with reactions, in-line comments, timestamped. Real-time updates ensure no one ever misses a beat.",
    "Cut approval cycles by 50% with reactions, in-line comments, timestamped. Real-time updates ensure no one ever misses a beat.",
    "3 Share once, use everywhere. From social campaigns to retailer toolkits, distribute your assets with one simple link you can update or revoke at any time.",
    "From social campaigns to retailer toolkits, distribute your assets with one simple link you can update or revoke at any time.",
    "David Bret, VP of Marketing at Warner Brothers Sports",
    "Send secure links for retailer portals, marketing kits, or seasonal launches. Revoke or update access anytime.",
    "Package your logos, campaign creative, and product shots into beautifully branded portals with Playbook Publish."
